Adds the "Performance:" line to the 10-second gpu_work_summary: swaps per second, frame time, draws, vertices and
command buffer stalls per swap, the time blocked on the GPU fence and on the submission thread, and the time the
command processor sat idle waiting for commands. The perf counters are compiled out of Release, so these come from
counters kept by the command processor. A bottleneck label follows only when the evidence separates the cases: GPU
or synchronization at 25% of the frame blocked, command processor when it is never blocked or idle, else UNKNOWN.
The audio system logs the effective audio_maxqframes once at startup.

